---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import MascotRocket from '../components/MascotRocket.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Agogpixel Studio & The A- Manifesto"
  description="Studio philosophy, curious software development, and the sardonic A- Manifesto."
>
  <div class="py-16 md:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-cyan/30 bg-cosmos-900/90 px-4 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan mb-4">
          <span class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan animate-pulse"></span>
          <span>Studio Profile</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl font-sans">
          Curious Software & <br />
          <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan via-brand-starlight to-brand-amber">
            Indie Game Development
          </span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-sans">
          AAA ambition. Indie grit. Minus the corporate bloat.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Mascot Showcase -->
      <div class="mb-16 flex justify-center">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-cosmos-800 bg-cosmos-900/60 p-8 text-center flex flex-col items-center shadow-lg">
          <MascotRocket size="md" animated={true} />
          <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-xs text-slate-400">
            The Agogpixel Mascot Rocket • Oscillating at &plusmn;45&deg; with Staggered Exhaust
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Narrative & Manifesto Sections -->
      <div class="space-y-16">
        <!-- Studio Overview (Tasteful Placeholder) -->
        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-cosmos-800 bg-cosmos-900/50 p-8 md:p-10">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-cyan font-semibold">About the Studio</span>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl font-sans">
            Independent by Design
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300 font-sans">
            <p>
              Agogpixel is an independent game development studio dedicated to crafting fast-paced retro sci-fi arcade experiences, tight mechanics, and curious software.
            </p>
            <p>
              We believe in small, nimble production cycles, sharp technical execution, and building software that respects the player's intelligence and time. Our studio explores novel physics interactions, tactile game feel, and lean, modern development workflows.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- The "A-" Manifesto (3 Sardonic Tenets) -->
        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-brand-cyan/20 bg-cosmos-900/70 p-8 md:p-10 shadow-xl shadow-cosmos-950/80">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-amber font-semibold">The Agogpixel Philosophy</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500">Classification: A-</span>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl font-sans">
            The "A-" Manifesto
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            The game industry loves its acronyms. "AAA" means a $150M budget, a 500-person credits roll, and three months of committee meetings to approve a color palette. "AA" means mid-budget publisher compromises.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            We call ourselves <strong class="text-brand-cyan">"A-"</strong>: a cheeky, self-aware moniker that subverts corporate pretense while demanding high technical craft. We know we're not a 500-person studio, and thank goodness for that. We build games you actually want to play.
          </p>

          <!-- The 3 Key Tenets -->
          <div class="mt-10 space-y-6">
            <!-- Tenet 1 -->
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-cosmos-800 bg-cosmos-950/80 p-5">
              <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-amber/10 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/30">
                01
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-sans">Minus the Corporate Bloat</h3>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-sans">
                  No endless steering committees, no 60-page design docs that gather dust, and zero corporate paralysis. We build directly in the engine, test what feels good, ruthlessly cut what doesn't, and keep shipping.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tenet 2 -->
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-cosmos-800 bg-cosmos-950/80 p-5">
              <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-cyan/10 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-brand-cyan border border-brand-cyan/30">
                02
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-sans">Player-First Purity</h3>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-sans">
                  Games are meant to be played, not monetized like digital slot machines. No predatory microtransactions, no battle passes, and no manipulative retention loops. Just tight controls, authentic physics, and arcade purity.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tenet 3 -->
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-cosmos-800 bg-cosmos-950/80 p-5">
              <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-scarlet/10 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-brand-scarlet border border-brand-scarlet/30">
                03
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-sans">Relentless Craft & Velocity</h3>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-sans">
                  We don't hide behind five-year conceptual roadmaps or vaporware promises. High technical standards, automated pipelines, clean architecture, and the discipline to deliver real games into players' hands.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Studio Principles -->
        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-cosmos-800 bg-cosmos-900/50 p-8 md:p-10">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 font-semibold">Our Approach</span>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl font-sans">
            Curious Software Development
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300 font-sans space-y-4">
            <p>
              "Curious Software Development" is our heritage motto. It means approaching problems with an open mind, questioning default industry dogmas, and building lightweight tools that serve creative momentum.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
